---
import RootLayout from "~/layouts/RootLayout.astro";
import Typography from "~/components/Typography.astro";
import ImageInline from "~/components/ImageInline.astro";
import avatar from "~/assets/avatar.webp";
---

<RootLayout class="page-index" title="Gab's Website">
  <ImageInline
    alt="Gab's face."
    class="profile"
    format="webp"
    height={175}
    quality={35}
    src={avatar}
    width={175}
  />

  <Typography class="heading" variant="h1">
    I'm Gab, and I like great UX.
  </Typography>

  <div class="content">
    <Typography>
      I'm a TypeScript enthusiast with over 10 years of experience in React. I'm
      all about creating great DevEx without compromising on UX. It helps when
      we avoid sending a 20 megabytes React SPA to people with an average mobile
      phone on a poor internet connection. Having a good developer experience on
      a powerful Macbook Pro shouldn't result in a degraded user experience for
      the people reaching a website. I highly recommend Alex Russell's series
      <a href="https://infrequently.org/series/performance-inequality/">
        The Performance Inequality Gap
        {/* eslint-disable-next-line prettier/prettier */}
      </a>, which he updates yearly with new device and network baselines.
    </Typography>

    <Typography>
      I'm having fun{" "}
      <a href="https://codeberg.org/100terres/selfhost">
        self-hosting tools and services
      </a>{" "}
      on my homelab. My current side projects' tech stack includes: TypeScript,
      Astro, Docker, Pangolin, Dagu, and Codeberg. I would like to eventually
      migrate my Docker setup to Kubernetes, we'll see if I find the time for
      this!
    </Typography>

    <Typography>
      I'm also maintaining{" "}
      <a href="https://github.com/hello-pangea/dnd">@hello-pangea/dnd</a>, an
      open source project I created by forking react-beautiful-dnd from
      Atlassian which now has 3,000,000+ weekly downloads on NPM. You can read
      more about my motivations behind{" "}
      <a href="https://dev.to/100terres/rbd-is-dead-long-life-rfd-1n9e">
        this adventure here
        {/* eslint-disable-next-line prettier/prettier */}
      </a>.
    </Typography>
  </div>
</RootLayout>

<style is:global>
  .page-index {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--size-large);

    .profile {
      border: var(--size-nano) solid var(--theme-on-surface);
      background-color: var(--theme-on-surface);
    }

    .heading {
      align-self: center;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .content {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2em;

      p {
        margin: 0;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      .content {
        grid-column: 1;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
